      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "passive",
        "description": "<p>Countdown (8). To cross the desert, the party must complete the countdown. It ticks down whenever a PC succeeds on an action roll to navigate the seemingly endless expanse.</p><section id=\"secret-mn0yB3t2n3Agrpn8\" class=\"secret\"><p>How do the PCs travel through the desert? What beyond the extreme distance and lack of water makes this area difficult to cross?</p></section>",
